WEBVTT

00:02:29.270 --> 00:02:32.398
leaving its hapless helper’s 
corpse behind.

00:02:33.691 --> 00:02:38.070
Next is the tiny but fierce
crypt-keeper wasp,

00:02:38.070 --> 00:02:41.282
which targets gall wasp larvae
like this one.

00:02:41.782 --> 00:02:47.705
The gall wasp larva is also parasitic,
but in a more vegetarian sense.

00:02:48.080 --> 00:02:50.291
It’s feasting on this oak tree,

00:02:50.291 --> 00:02:53.794
tucked away in a chamber on one of its
branches.

00:02:54.253 --> 00:02:56.422
Soon, it has company.

00:02:57.089 --> 00:03:00.968
The crypt-keeper wasp adds
her egg into the mix.